<title>CHINA: IDT Int'l forms electronic games division.</title>
<headline>IDT Int'l forms electronic games division.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDT International Ltd said on Wednesday it had formed a new division to design, manufacture and distribute hand-held electronic toys and games.</p>
<p>The electronic products maker said it has budgeted some HK$25 million for equipment, plant and machinery.</p>
<p>Substantial orders, mainly from customers in Japan and the United States, had already been received and order books were filled for some four months ahead, it added.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
